Commit:     lp <lp@nexxar.com>
CommitDate: Wed Dec 10 14:02:28 2025 +0000

    Bug 1987654 - store every calendar-user-address a caldav server reports and use it to check attendee status. r=darktrojan,tobyp

    now tracks each alias the server reports in the calenderUserAddresses list
    knows every “me” address in both ACL and non-ACL scenarios
    iTIP invite handling can locate the correct attendee even when the server already stored the event or the invite was sent to an alias
    RSVP UI behaves correctly for both the main account address and any alias: invitation summary opens, buttons are shown, partstat updates remove the “You haven’t responded” warning.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D273346

